data/runs/

# The response archive is deliberately NOT discarded. The model is
# non-deterministic and exposes no seed, so the code alone does not reproduce
# the reported numbers -- only the saved responses do. The working cache is
# 110k loose files, which git handles badly, so it is published as compressed
# bundles under data/archive/ instead.
data/cache/
data/cache_*/

# Paper figures are generated, but the paper needs them, so the ones it
# includes are tracked.
figures/*.png
!figures/fig1_market_size.png
!figures/fig2_wording.png
!figures/zi_price_path.png

# LaTeX build products
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.synctex.gz
